WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.312
Eddy, Jeb, and Gasser were playing.

2
00:00:16.313 --> 00:00:20.588
"I love dirt," Jeb said.

3
00:00:20.588 --> 00:00:27.628
"I love jumping!" Gasser said.

4
00:00:27.629 --> 00:00:30.802
He drove fast toward a pile.

5
00:00:30.803 --> 00:00:39.695
Gasser flew through the air.

6
00:00:39.696 --> 00:00:46.638
Mr. Grill came outside.

7
00:00:46.639 --> 00:00:52.873
"Good morning, students!" he said.

8
00:00:52.873 --> 00:00:56.896
"Do we have safety class today?" Zippy asked.

9
00:00:56.897 --> 00:00:59.730
"That's so boring."

10
00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:02.777
"No," Mr. Grill said.

11
00:01:02.777 --> 00:01:06.567
"We're doing something fun today."

12
00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:09.575
"What is it?" Eddy asked.

13
00:01:09.575 --> 00:01:12.613
"Tell us!" Poppy said.

14
00:01:12.614 --> 00:01:15.290
Mr. Grill smiled.

15
00:01:15.291 --> 00:01:18.049
"I'm not telling yet.

16
00:01:18.049 --> 00:01:22.377
It's a mystery!"

17
00:01:22.377 --> 00:01:26.078
"When will you tell us?" Jeb asked.

18
00:01:26.079 --> 00:01:29.697
"This afternoon," Mr. Grill said.

19
00:01:29.698 --> 00:01:38.515
"Meet me in the parking lot."

20
00:01:38.516 --> 00:01:42.698
That afternoon the students met.

21
00:01:42.699 --> 00:01:54.904
They parked in the parking lot.

22
00:01:54.905 --> 00:01:58.198
"Um," Dipper said.

23
00:01:58.198 --> 00:02:05.664
"Where is Mr. Grill?"

